{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Welcome to <strong>Catlands -</strong> a cozy world filled with puzzles and charming cats</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Variety to Delight You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every puzzle is unique. The landscape changes every time! And with optional modifiers, the gameplay stays fresh for a long time. Calm puzzles, satisfying results.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/fd83bb44a6b24ba53814f39cb493918d.poster.avif?t=1773133103\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/fd83bb44a6b24ba53814f39cb493918d.webm?t=1773133103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/fd83bb44a6b24ba53814f39cb493918d.mp4?t=1773133103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Home Built by Your Hands</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Build your own village from the ground up. Design a cozy corner and invite those cute cats you met on puzzle adventures</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/da8513ba7a51f1d75beb48b251f510d8.poster.avif?t=1773133103\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/da8513ba7a51f1d75beb48b251f510d8.webm?t=1773133103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/da8513ba7a51f1d75beb48b251f510d8.mp4?t=1773133103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Silly cats</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cute feline villagers live and chat. Interact with them, and share a laugh. Complete their quests to earn more tiles for the village</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/056c8070b2a8a783f614f8de07ddf098.poster.avif?t=1773133103\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/056c8070b2a8a783f614f8de07ddf098.webm?t=1773133103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/056c8070b2a8a783f614f8de07ddf098.mp4?t=1773133103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Calm and Cozy Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Solve puzzles without rush in your own temp. Watch fields, forests, and rivers come to life and turn into peaceful landscapes</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/66fadf54db0cf3aab8264e96577531ca.poster.avif?t=1773133103\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/66fadf54db0cf3aab8264e96577531ca.webm?t=1773133103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/66fadf54db0cf3aab8264e96577531ca.mp4?t=1773133103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3581890?t=1773133103","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/de693ad31def1724572b146ba38f198b78274c61/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773133103","ca